flowchart LR
  Feeds[RSS feeds] --> Sources[Sources and collector]
  GH[GitHub REST API] --> Discovery[Discovery providers]
  Podcasts[Podcast feeds] --> Discovery
  Discord[Discord interactions] --> Commands[Slash commands and selection buttons]
  Cron[node-cron scheduler] --> Jobs[News / discovery / cleanup jobs]
  Commands --> Jobs
  Jobs --> Sources
  Jobs --> Discovery
  Sources --> Editorial[Classifier, relevance, grouping, selection]
  Editorial --> Publications[Publication services and intents]
  Discovery --> Publications
  Publications --> AI[OpenRouter completion and budget]
  AI --> OpenRouter[OpenRouter API]
  Sources --> DB[(PostgreSQL / Drizzle)]
  Editorial --> DB
  Jobs --> DB
  Publications --> DB
  Publications --> Discord
  Commands --> Briefing[Personal Markdown briefing]
  Briefing --> AI
  Briefing --> DB
  Briefing --> Discord
